# shell: tracker
# home: fixture
# work: home
# prefs: navigator-off
# CW-054: the shared setting hides and shows the navigator without history.
wait 8
expect-navigator 0
expect-visible-rows 21

note history continues to grow while its chrome is hidden
click-row 0
click-row 0
wait 6
key Left ctrl
wait 6
expect-location /tmp/trk_home/.trk-shell-fixture
expect-nav-forward 1

note removing the global override restores the bar and recomputes the view
remove /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings
wait 20
expect-navigator 1
expect-visible-rows 20
expect-nav-forward 1
click 52 57
wait 6
expect-location /tmp/trk_home/.trk-shell-fixture/sub
quit
